+**Expected response** (values in cents):
+
+```json
+{
+  "id": 1,
+  "user_id": 1,
+  "subtotal": 10000,
+  "discount_code": "SAVE10",
+  "discount_percentage": 10,
+  "discount_amount": 1000,
+  "final_total": 9000,
+  "items": [...],
+  "created_at": "..."
+}
+```
+
+---
+
+## Step 5: Verify error paths
+
+```bash
